GENERE, 0N LECON, 11 QUIZ

CHOIX: id_choix [INTEGER], texte [TEXT], est_correct [BOOLEAN]
PROPOSE, 0N QUESTION, 11 CHOIX
QUESTION: id_question [INTEGER], texte [TEXT], type_question [VARCHAR(20)], explication [TEXT], reponse_attendue [TEXT], ordre [INTEGER]
COMPOSE, 1N QUIZ, 11 QUESTION
QUIZ: id_quiz [INTEGER], titre [VARCHAR(100)], description [TEXT], difficulte [VARCHAR(20)], statut [VARCHAR(20)], date_creation [DATETIME], date_validation [DATETIME]
